# OPEN FRONTIER: the second departure. Everything above is
# verified -- the board now "pulses with light" -- but no
# combination of alarm state, presses, waits, and clock rewinds
# fires the next travel under this timeline (dice ruled out by a
# 100-turn matrix probe; the first departure's shape does not
# repeat). The gate is game state not yet identified; the next
# instrument is disassembly (ztools txd) of the departure daemon.
